  "description": {
   "en": "Anzu is a high school girl living under the strict control of her mother, in a household where the idea of defying her will is unthinkable. With no smartphone and no allowance, one of her few escapes is sneaking away to a nearby CD shop and listening to music.\n\nBut one night, in the plaza outside a train station, she encounters a shady-looking guy who has the looks of a devil... but plays the guitar like an angel."
  },
